{"id": "3291711", "name": "פונקציה סתומה, מישור משיק ונגזרת מעורבת - גרסה מעוצבת", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 2, "functions": [{"name": "coef", "params": ["i", "j", "k"], "body": "coeff(coeff(coeff(Fraw,x,i),y,j),z,k)"}], "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width: 980px; margin: 0 auto; font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; color: #1f2937; line-height: 1.65; text-align: right;\">\n<div style=\"background: #F4F1F5; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 18px; margin-bottom: 18px;\">\n<div style=\"font-size: 19px; font-weight: bold; color: #4b1f6f; margin-bottom: 10px;\">פונקציה סתומה, מישור משיק ונגזרת מעורבת</div>\n<p style=\"margin: 5px 0 10px 0;\">נתונה המשוואה</p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; text-align: center; font-size: 18px; background: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 9px; padding: 12px 14px; margin-bottom: 12px;\">\\(\\displaystyle {{CT:0}}={{CT:1}}\\)</div>\n<p style=\"margin: 8px 0 0 0;\">ידוע כי בסביבה של הנקודה \\(P={{CT:2}}\\) המשוואה מגדירה פונקציה סתומה \\(z=f(x,y)\\).</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 18px; margin-bottom: 16px; background: #FFFFFF;\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 9px; margin-bottom: 10px;\"><span style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; background: #EEECEF; color: #4b1f6f; font-weight: bold;\">א</span> <span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold; color: #4b1f6f;\">המישור המשיק</span></div>\n<p style=\"margin: 5px 0 12px 0;\">מצאו את משוואת המישור המשיק לגרף \\(z=f(x,y)\\) בנקודה \\(P\\).</p>\n<div style=\"background: #FAF9FB; border: 1px solid #EEECEF; border-radius: 10px; padding: 14px;\">\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; gap: 10px; flex-wrap: wrap; font-size: 18px;\">\\(\\displaystyle z=\\) [[input:ans1]]</div>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; text-align: center; margin-top: 5px;\">[[validation:ans1]]</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 18px; background: #FFFFFF;\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 9px; margin-bottom: 10px;\"><span style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; background: #EEECEF; color: #4b1f6f; font-weight: bold;\">ב</span> <span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold; color: #4b1f6f;\">נגזרת מעורבת מסדר שני</span></div>\n<p style=\"margin: 5px 0 12px 0;\">חשבו את \\(f''_{xy}({{CT:3}},{{CT:4}})\\).</p>\n<div style=\"background: #FAF9FB; border: 1px solid #EEECEF; border-radius: 10px; padding: 14px;\">\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; gap: 10px; flex-wrap: wrap; font-size: 18px;\">\\(\\displaystyle f''_{xy}({{CT:3}},{{CT:4}})=\\) [[input:ans2]]</div>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; text-align: center; margin-top: 5px;\">[[validation:ans2]]</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"text-align: right; line-height: 1.75; max-width: 920px; margin: 0 auto; color: #1f2937;\">\n<div style=\"background: #F4F1F5; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 18px;\">\n<div style=\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold; color: #4b1f6f; margin-bottom: 10px;\">פתרון מלא</div>\n<p style=\"margin: 6px 0;\">נסמן את אגף שמאל של המשוואה ב־\\(F(x,y,z)\\). מאחר ש־\\(z=f(x,y)\\), מתקיים \\(F(x,y,f(x,y))=0\\).</p>\n<p style=\"margin: 6px 0;\">נגזור לפי \\(x\\) ולפי \\(y\\):</p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; text-align: center; background: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 9px; padding: 10px; margin: 8px 0 14px 0; line-height: 1.9;\">\n<div>\\(\\displaystyle F'_x+F'_z f'_x=0\\)</div>\n<div>\\(\\displaystyle F'_y+F'_z f'_y=0\\)</div>\n</div>\n<p style=\"margin: 6px 0;\">בנקודה \\(P\\) מתקיים \\(F'_z(P)=1\\), \\(F'_x(P)={{CT:5}}\\), \\(F'_y(P)={{CT:6}}\\), ולכן</p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; text-align: center; background: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 9px; padding: 10px; margin: 8px 0 14px 0; line-height: 1.9;\">\n<div>\\(\\displaystyle f'_x({{CT:3}},{{CT:4}})={{CT:7}}\\)</div>\n<div>\\(\\displaystyle f'_y({{CT:3}},{{CT:4}})={{CT:8}}\\)</div>\n</div>\n<p style=\"margin: 6px 0;\">לכן המישור המשיק הוא</p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; text-align: center; background: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 9px; padding: 10px; margin: 8px 0 14px 0;\">\\(\\displaystyle z={{CT:9}}+{{CT:7}}(x-{{CT:3}})+{{CT:8}}(y-{{CT:4}})={{CT:10}} \\)</div>\n<p style=\"margin: 6px 0;\">כעת נגזור לפי \\(y\\) את הזהות \\(F'_x+F'_z f'_x=0\\):</p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; text-align: center; background: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 9px; padding: 10px; margin: 8px 0 14px 0;\">\\(\\displaystyle F''_{xy}+F''_{xz}f'_y+F''_{yz}f'_x+F''_{zz}f'_x f'_y+F'_z f''_{xy}=0 \\)</div>\n<p style=\"margin: 6px 0;\">בנקודה \\(P\\) מתקיים \\(F''_{xy}(P)={{CT:11}}\\), \\(F''_{xz}(P)={{CT:12}}\\), \\(F''_{yz}(P)={{CT:13}}\\), \\(F''_{zz}(P)={{CT:14}}\\), \\(F'_z(P)=1\\). לכן</p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; text-align: center; background: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 9px; padding: 10px; margin: 8px 0 0 0;\">\\(\\displaystyle f''_{xy}({{CT:3}},{{CT:4}}) = -\\left( {{CT:11}}+{{CT:12}}\\cdot{{CT:8}}+{{CT:13}}\\cdot{{CT:7}}+{{CT:14}}\\cdot{{CT:7}}\\cdot{{CT:8}} \\right) = {{CT:15}} \\)</div>\n</div>\n</div>", "specificfeedback": "<p>[[feedback:pplane]] [[feedback:papprox]]</p>", "prtcorrect": "", "prtpartiallycorrect": "", "prtincorrect": "", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans2", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "papprox", "value": 0.55, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans2", "tans": "tans2", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "papprox-1-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"text-align: right;\"><strong>נכון.</strong> הנגזרת המעורבת חושבה נכון.</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "papprox-1-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"text-align: right;\">גזרו לפי \\(y\\) את \\(F'_x+F'_z f'_x=0\\). אל תשכחו שגם \\(F'_x\\) וגם \\(F'_z\\) תלויות ב־\\(x,y,z\\).</div>"}}]}, {"name": "pplane", "value": 0.45, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "tans1", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "pplane-1-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"text-align: right;\"><strong>נכון.</strong> משוואת המישור המשיק נכונה.</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "pplane-1-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"text-align: right;\">השתמשו ב־\\(F'_x+F'_z f'_x=0\\) וב־\\(F'_y+F'_z f'_y=0\\), ואז כתבו את המישור המשיק.</div>"}}]}], "qvnames": ["A", "B", "C", "D", "E", "F", "Fleft", "Fraw", "Fright", "G", "H", "K", "L", "Ptuple", "X", "Y", "Z", "c000", "c001", "c002", "c003", "c010", "c011", "c020", "c030", "c100", "c101", "c110", "c200", "c210", "c300", "case1", "case2", "case3", "case4", "cfg", "configs", "cubic", "extra", "fam", "fx0", "fxy0", "fy0", "fzz0", "negside", "plane", "posside", "tans1", "tans2", "x0", "y0", "z0", "zsign"], "nvariants": 50}